---

## 9. Limitations & Future Scope (v0.1)

The v0.1 release focuses on proving mathematical validity and benchmarking the core user-level Central DP mechanisms. The following advanced capabilities are deliberately scoped for future releases:
- **Longitudinal Composition & RDP Accountant**: v0.1 supports single release budget checks with an accountant interface ready for future Rényi DP accounting.
- **Adaptive Privacy Budgeting**: Budgets are statically allocated per query.
- **Dynamic Taxonomy & Top-K**: Task and provider categories are fixed to the primary 3x3 grid.
- **Continual Observation**: Queries represent static snapshot aggregation over a window.
